    "title": "New motions filed in Murdaugh case seek change of venue, independent DNA analysis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Perrin Moore ,\n7 hours ago COLLETON COUNTY, S.C. (WCIV) — Alex Murdaugh’s attorneys filed several motions Wednesday, one of which seeks to move the case out of Colleton County. In one of three filings, Murdaugh’s defense team wrote that due to the “especially intense” coverage the case has received in the Fourteenth Judicial Circuit, which comprises of Allendale, Beaufort, Colleton, Hampton, and Jasper Counties, their client cannot receive “the fair and impartial trial guaranteed to him.” Read full article",
